---
source: crates/hird-check/tests/actors.rs
expression: "check_str(\"type Status = Status(Int)\\n\\\n         type Pending = Pending(Option<ReplyTo<Status>>)\\n\\\n         actor A {\\n\\\n           state: Pending,\\n\\\n           message: Msg = | Ask(ReplyTo<Status>) | Halt,\\n\\\n           init: fn(s: Pending) -> Pending ! {} = s,\\n\\\n           handle Ask(r), st -> Next<Pending> ! {} = Continue(st),\\n\\\n           handle Halt, st -> Next<Pending> ! {} = Continue(st),\\n\\\n         }\")"
---
Ask : ReplyTo<Status> → Msg
Halt : Msg
Pending : Option<ReplyTo<Status>> → Pending
Status : Int → Status
